  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Research Ideas LAND-at-scale - Amahoro-at-scale in Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research will focus on the impact of the state land inventory process and the impact of systematic land tenure registration and certification on land-related investments. These research questions are identified during the MTR and longitudinal study. The findings will contribute to the findings from the ongoing longitudinal study and inform the exit strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
